===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The [[Communist]] philosophies espoused by Soviet Leader Josef Stalin.
# The act or state of living in accord with the communist philosophies of Stalin.
# [[totalitarianism|Totalitarianism]], by extension from the rigid governing methods of Stalin.

